concepts.content:
The $\mathbb{1}$ is the indicator function, which is defined as:
$$\begin{equation*}
    \mathbb{1}(x) = \begin{cases}
                1 & \text{if $x$ is true} \\
                0 & \text{otherwise}
             \end{cases}
\end{equation*}$$

